sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (Browser)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as FastAPI Backend<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Ollama as Ollama LLM<br/>11434/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SQLite as SQLite DB<br/>(PVC)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 1: Recommendation Pipeline

    User->>Route: HTTPS POST (use case description)
    Route->>UI: HTTP (TLS terminated at edge)
    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/extract-intent
    Backend->>Ollama: LLM inference request<br/>(intent extraction)
    Ollama-->>Backend: Structured intent JSON
    Backend-->>UI: Intent response

    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-specification
    Backend->>Backend: Build specification<br/>(traffic profiles, SLO targets)
    Backend-->>UI: Deployment specification

    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-recommendations
    Backend->>HF: Fetch model metadata<br/>(architecture, params)
    HF-->>Backend: Model config
    Backend->>SQLite: Query benchmark data
    SQLite-->>Backend: Performance benchmarks
    Backend->>Backend: Multi-criteria scoring<br/>(quality/price/latency)
    Backend-->>UI: Ranked recommendations

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Kubernetes Deployment

    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/generate-deployment
    Backend->>Backend: Render Jinja2 templates<br/>(KServe InferenceService YAML)
    Backend-->>UI: Generated YAML bundle

    UI->>Backend: POST /api/v1/deploy-bundle-to-cluster
    Backend->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply<br/>(ServiceAccount token auth)
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Deployment status
    Backend-->>UI: Deployment result
    UI-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: HTTPS response

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Model Catalog Sync (RHOAI)

    participant MC as Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Backend->>MC: GET benchmarks<br/>(Bearer token, TLS service CA)
    MC-->>Backend: Benchmark data
    Backend->>SQLite: Store benchmarks
